<p local-id=3D"4afaba89-003e-443c-af4a-f12aa849cc4d">NEXTGEN: Assembled the=
 pellet-based extruder for Pourya=E2=80=99s gantry.</p>
<p local-id=3D"776d2afa-d113-4a85-9ceb-f8dbc8b2905c">REDRESS: Did a test he=
ating the PMMA/PEG/SA powder made yesterday in a ceramic crucible to 250F. =
The green part held its shape when overturned out of the ceramic crucible b=
ut was not hard enough to prevent indentation from a toothpick. When I mixe=
d up that batch of powder the components of the liquid binder had not compl=
etely dissolved, so I mixed up a new batch of powder with the now-fully-mix=
ed binder liquid, with a 10% liquid binder load.</p>
<p local-id=3D"f898d729-c8d6-4118-be9b-9188ddc6a4a9"></p>
<p local-id=3D"e2bc69a0-878c-4ff3-8ff8-9b4109a9188a">2025-03-12</p>
<p local-id=3D"2b691ec5-989e-4e23-b822-dc952bb19cdd">REDRESS: Generated a n=
ew pre-coated powder binder with assistance from Claude:</p><span class=3D"=
confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-m=
anual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image image-center" alt=3D"im=
age-20250312-233603.png" width=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"9df36a3c26d0=
da556d441e90556b1cf6c6868877d38ffea848d1065dd3847166" data-image-src=3D"htt=
ps://3deo.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/867500072/image-20250312-=
233603.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1741822567717&amp;cacheVersio=
