<h2 local-id=3D"bfcce83a-0a75-4e85-9407-8514b32a6320" id=3D"JaredHumphreysL=
og-PreparationProcedure">Preparation Procedure</h2>
<h3 local-id=3D"fc95b0d9-0388-4dc3-a0a9-fa08689171e5" id=3D"JaredHumphreysL=
og-EquipmentRequired">Equipment Required</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"b0a937c1-cb58-4d72-80c3-3baaa6de7e59">
<li local-id=3D"c5598741-144c-4c51-8830-2a68216d4d54">
<p local-id=3D"117db61c-73eb-48ba-9c53-864361372dd8">Precision analytical b=
alance</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"e40422a7-f494-4463-9002-85123c93349e">
<p local-id=3D"38b4cca1-fee0-461a-bf9b-d0a42f7fcd70">Glass mixing vessel</p=
></li>
<li local-id=3D"c478026d-fb03-42d3-bdff-edad8f8eead3">
<p local-id=3D"08d57bda-6065-40f1-9f78-de3ca1bc8c07">Magnetic stirrer</p></=
li>
<li local-id=3D"96a24e6f-9aa9-4a2e-976c-bb13aa75d101">
<p local-id=3D"9944430a-8cb0-42e3-b853-c55ebee2e76c">Fume hood</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"4f28bcd3-a03c-4a8a-96c6-dac4eb2d515d">
<p local-id=3D"d1c3ae4c-8c69-4517-8f50-6bbce18ce6d3">Personal protective eq=
uipment (gloves, safety glasses)</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"36f5a95f-efac-44a9-9dd0-646346cdaf41" id=3D"JaredHumphreysL=
og-DetailedMixingInstructions">Detailed Mixing Instructions</h3>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"64d2089f-eafc-4e11-9537-5106340cd4fa">
<li local-id=3D"cdcac449-5464-4376-b21a-120c3eaf4f85">
<p local-id=3D"28f0ca64-fe3b-4128-a248-3a1deaa7b8fb"><strong>Preparation Se=
tup</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"b1f95ac4-f092-4530-b367-41acc518b153">
<li local-id=3D"326e06b5-0e39-4f7b-9d30-73d6b71bb8bf">
<p local-id=3D"7739cc59-e5e6-479b-b710-0aa7d4a7e6b7">Ensure clean, dry work=
ing environment</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"93474d7e-7a37-4f47-a221-43bb1f2ab1ca">
<p local-id=3D"1e3c9739-a74b-463d-8697-1f66c7e1e837">Use calibrated precisi=
on balance</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"b8d15c21-9d96-4b0d-957c-dc51a0901e86">
<p local-id=3D"1197f6cc-f66e-4d9b-ac3c-661831dbee81">Work in well-ventilate=
d area or fume hood</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"07be9c46-654b-4cd3-8f1b-44f482f73e05">
<p local-id=3D"41b2e428-c589-4f3d-8fc2-1bae949dfcf6"><strong>Solvent Prepar=
ation</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"915f637a-9698-41c9-927a-9ee10b89cf97">
<li local-id=3D"3927eb69-8bb3-4eba-bf89-73528ce1d86d">
<p local-id=3D"b8153371-7efc-49d6-932c-a1bf05208e83">Measure 90g of acetone=
 into clean glass vessel</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"b526343a-93d4-43a8-ae17-a33bbfd574ed">
<p local-id=3D"15ae3c46-0230-46a4-8b49-86d82faeaf9b">Begin gentle magnetic =
stirring at 200-300 RPM</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"c5daa3ff-31ae-4ce8-a8a3-9517f65f3b76">
<p local-id=3D"daaed652-2b24-4dd3-98a6-74c7b5e93f5f"><strong>Polymer Dissol=
ution</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"e509787e-73f7-466f-8bb1-3c591e7efe9e">
<li local-id=3D"5a3025e8-dc5f-4174-8961-fb8891a9d830">
<p local-id=3D"ebaf80e4-bb46-4e36-86b6-f76db5250cda">Slowly add 20.1g PMMA =
to acetone</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"85f35786-f6ed-47c5-b395-4061d10c653f">
<p local-id=3D"be812419-d77f-4c8a-977f-0670005810c2">Stir until completely =
dissolved (15-20 minutes)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"cc123f81-689e-4c08-9b92-fd8db3ce1707">
<p local-id=3D"8497d3e5-1084-4cc3-a4b7-ae90ac43eb7d">Ensure no visible undi=
ssolved particles</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"d9333022-f8cc-46bc-a39b-59c60d2872af">
<p local-id=3D"5741ca2d-0e9b-4fc1-be38-36cfb95586a9"><strong>Additive Incor=
poration</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"be45cb57-8b11-44af-bba3-1b9f9ad09317">
<li local-id=3D"5fc04334-7ef9-47c3-a47d-866fa03ed416">
<p local-id=3D"7e0ad378-d8a3-4e64-8ded-0007da2638f9">Add 2.4g DBP, mix for =
5 minutes</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"60fd1e43-e52c-4fe8-bf2f-59818f556f39">
<p local-id=3D"6f152c1d-68ce-4e64-9aa5-d08cac02eb7b">Add 2.1g 3-(trimethoxy=
silyl)propyl methacrylate, mix thoroughly</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"457eecf6-5a35-4604-a626-b7705a18bdf1">
<p local-id=3D"0afa18ae-5990-472c-8c7a-b4514c829c87">Add 0.9g stearic acid,=
 ensure complete dispersion</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"cc3164b4-ef11-4fe4-bac8-3e036a780391">
<p local-id=3D"e0aa5840-4541-458e-8a44-bd54c011e011"><strong>Crosslinker Ad=
dition</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"1a9ad139-d7e4-4a47-b77d-1c7b1e87e044">
<li local-id=3D"435f9983-377b-45ec-9de5-fdb732b69ae6">
<p local-id=3D"0625b7b4-15f4-4e84-a8bf-bcce473f2b5e">Add 4.5g TEG-DMA</p></=
li>
<li local-id=3D"9a1bea5d-b274-4f20-9f83-90a9c54b7f15">
<p local-id=3D"bb7c8305-4b81-45bb-ad8d-ed22ae03183f">Mix for 3-5 minutes</p=
></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"db64fe68-eac9-403b-b6b3-fb923757d56b">
<p local-id=3D"23c4d99b-2fc5-45fc-9d68-370cff8aadac"><strong>Catalyst Incor=
poration</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"65c0add8-9662-4293-b875-300ba53c25b4">
<li local-id=3D"feed6104-421d-4361-ad08-a7c4d75c80e4">
<p local-id=3D"76136ae4-0dcb-4de5-a584-5075edc935c9">Add 1.2g polyester res=
in catalyst</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"c36294eb-8b93-4255-adae-5cd00dae22a5">
<p local-id=3D"1a0ca02c-9840-41a1-beec-adef988ef9b5">Mix quickly and thorou=
ghly (30-45 seconds)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"b54c0dcd-3d2a-4adc-9ea7-bcffbadfe939">
<p local-id=3D"1fa0b773-e09d-4cd4-bcd8-014b5b10fd04">Avoid prolonged mixing=
 to prevent premature activation</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ol>
<h3 local-id=3D"ba0f5035-f9eb-470f-8d9d-63a0eb967670" id=3D"JaredHumphreysL=
og-PowderCoatingProcess">Powder Coating Process</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"61e8a1fc-c5e4-4c70-b29b-f546da0d8ff8">
<li local-id=3D"2d9edfd2-1a19-4209-8128-be1344ccb882">
<p local-id=3D"63963580-5baa-4e8f-9656-9de4e67f1e0c">Immediately mix with m=
etal powder</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d5735ff1-a1ed-4c6f-ad81-04e2b92fbcfa">
<p local-id=3D"217300a4-6b4c-40fe-a5c5-03a0ec303393">Spread in thin, unifor=
m layers (max 5mm thickness)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"186c0bb6-5e31-4903-850f-afb359cf725d">
<p local-id=3D"74a71009-d75f-4630-9d73-eb3c152d4e36">Dry at room temperatur=
e (20-25=C2=B0C)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ecab4c2e-8075-49a4-8767-9d50af26a6ce">
<p local-id=3D"fd9c962c-0506-4e03-9d85-e0132898ef88">Drying time: 18-24 hou=
rs</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"37e9c2b8-6f2e-46d1-8442-82ad64a66160">
<p local-id=3D"7d3bdf2c-1cc1-4da4-84c5-8d0bafde199a">Avoid direct sunlight =
or heat sources</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"e7b52d2c-3437-44c4-afbe-0cb6c44fa83d" id=3D"JaredHumphreysL=
og-CuringParameters">Curing Parameters</h2>
<ul local-id=3D"811f43dc-a348-4027-bef2-f9a4083c13c5">
<li local-id=3D"ebe5f46d-638e-408a-b54f-d4e173253078">
<p local-id=3D"0cfa0c62-2fe8-4222-aba9-902af5857fac">Heating Rate: 2-3=C2=
=B0C/minute</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"2e0b5bcd-36b9-4f76-ac5d-4b9772279e75">
<p local-id=3D"1e7b2aa1-932f-463f-b04a-6a5453fe761f">Peak Temperature: 90=
=C2=B0C</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"9b80e867-9f51-46b3-86d8-5ace5e413655">
<p local-id=3D"c4ce0433-7e78-4d18-985c-1f96247abde8">Hold Time: 60-75 minut=
es</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"7188eed2-db98-4999-85ce-e8e0809de834">
<p local-id=3D"393f0a3b-6f10-42d5-9c32-10c76dda2757">Cooling: Slow, natural=
 cooling to room temperature</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"d0058925-d15d-44e3-87f4-15dc5c9fe105" id=3D"JaredHumphreysL=
og-SafetyandStorage">Safety and Storage</h2>
<ul local-id=3D"14ff99b2-b35e-4475-816e-61fe5bd0b0da">
<li local-id=3D"c072cc6e-d8f5-4e32-9927-043da729fb16">
<p local-id=3D"7c905018-145a-4e8d-981f-3c6105037a9b">Store components in co=
ol, dry place</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"5f44d206-fcff-443b-b886-afffed088d1d">
<p local-id=3D"a3640963-d826-444b-b75a-7016e3de460d">Keep away from heat an=
d direct sunlight</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a5951abc-7680-4855-9d14-54efecbf3e90">
<p local-id=3D"2f0b823a-4b1d-44ca-855c-695179d4e7fb">Catalyst is light and =
heat sensitive</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"9b3aab8b-6abe-4a59-b142-6d7df7ec0e83">
<p local-id=3D"6b2c2cbc-e283-4b3f-8872-5e37fd8b9da5">Use within 3 months of=
 preparation</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"b9312fb6-c528-44c7-844b-78684743a25b" id=3D"JaredHumphreysL=
og-QualityControlNotes">Quality Control Notes</h2>
<ul local-id=3D"38828a1c-8616-4771-a33c-db593fe03fe2">
<li local-id=3D"c77fe8ef-28ce-4677-8ce8-a961a4565b19">
<p local-id=3D"6d40bc04-6ca1-4390-bd25-2fc804f944db">Check viscosity before=
 use</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"4f91c283-1005-4b7d-b557-fca06372ca56">
<p local-id=3D"fb364419-9908-4525-9c72-e2abc811115d">Ensure homogeneous mix=
ture</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"4c697ba4-f347-4f84-90db-aac9daa2902b">
<p local-id=3D"5ef01395-414d-4a6a-a435-52ee43dfba4b">Verify no visible part=
iculate separation</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"ba72631f-4251-4e5e-ac6d-c8e02dc2f4df"><strong>Caution</stron=
g>: Contains volatile and potentially harmful chemicals. Use appropriate pe=
rsonal protective equipment.</p>
<p local-id=3D"3fca6fe7-d4bc-4688-b11a-3a43563f074d">PXL: Emergency meeting=
 about delivering a functional plate by 4/11. Evidently Samer at AEM is pus=
hing Scott to deliver a plate by 4/11, so the purpose of this meeting was t=
o determine the feasibility of making a plate with the 2.5mm horizontal fla=
nge lap joint by then. The general conclusion of the meeting was that it is=
 probably feasible to make Unit 6 by 4/11 exactly the same as Unit 5, but c=
hanging the horizontal flange lap joint to 2.5mm is essentially the scope o=
f the 6 month redesign project we were trying to get AEM to pay us for, and=
 thus is unlikely to be done within 3 weeks.</p>
<p local-id=3D"e8b32863-600f-486a-a108-17e94ee38f1c"></p>
<p local-id=3D"0c1a31f4-01ef-437d-b042-46bb5e198fee">2025-03-25</p>
<p local-id=3D"e3984f03-bfa4-40ea-a565-ec5bff86e54c">PXL: Setting up Unit 5=
 for rebraze 3 today. Recommended max number of rebraze attempts is 2, but =
that is more of a rule of thumb than a hard spec. AEM wants to ship a funct=
ional unit on 4/11, which means we would need to deliver it by 4/4, the Fri=
day of next week. We are discussing possible design changes to Unit 6 to im=
prove probability of sealing, including eliminating capillary gap to buy .0=
10=E2=80=9D per side of flange overlap, skipping plating and blister testin=
g of copper parts to help reduce distortion and brazing the parts without h=
aving plated the copper, etc. Had 3 Troy Ounces of BAg-8 wire delivered fro=
m McMaster via courier. Completed wiring plate in preparation for rebraze.<=
/p>
<p local-id=3D"62700bea-9d81-463e-9709-6e9794fa88ef">Cleanup. Assembled 36=
=E2=80=9D fume hood for wax/chemical experiments in heavy R&amp;D lab, but =
it arrived without a filter so that will need to be purchased separately.</=
p>
<p local-id=3D"3fe54c04-7466-43c9-a350-e040300e1442">REDRESS:Metal Powder B=
inder Formulation</p>
