<h2 local-id=3D"5218152b-92ad-418c-a6a1-fa64c682c517" id=3D"JaredHumphreysL=
og-Rationalefor4%PVP-VA">Rationale for 4% PVP-VA</h2>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"a952c711-fb9a-4e2e-8e1f-92cb1734931e">
<li local-id=3D"0dd01eee-3116-4c1f-94f0-35fc477269db">
<p local-id=3D"218ada53-f43e-4a4a-ac48-be4bb067d7c7">Increased Flow Charact=
eristics</p>
<ul local-id=3D"9b662ee4-e17b-4bf5-b147-23811f24b6c2">
<li local-id=3D"fcd1b8c3-4c4c-4f02-9a63-4c9c5ed3379c">
<p local-id=3D"29d57f69-2f3b-4e87-b53c-464c2ff38463">More pronounced powder=
 dispersibility</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"364d7e0f-1c3c-4797-bb13-f91238ac0a67">
<p local-id=3D"29111904-49f7-493e-9390-21eb797fe10e">Enhanced initial mixin=
g properties</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"3aa377a6-c9b8-4263-8d9c-6a24bcf660e9">
<p local-id=3D"4e677c59-ff2a-4b3b-a2ca-a860e0e98099">Potential improvement =
in green body uniformity</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"06727ae5-14cd-489c-a6c7-694fde78d2fc">
<p local-id=3D"2608a370-210f-48b2-bb4d-2ec4e65ce833">Balanced Composition</=
p>
<ul local-id=3D"8c696ef5-53d5-4b95-b5df-b0a3b3a01590">
<li local-id=3D"9333a954-d664-4141-9f44-d28a6e14fb11">
<p local-id=3D"9881a14c-88e3-4f06-8641-ad6631996e94">Reduced PMMA to accomm=
odate increased PVP-VA</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ff0b0c23-cd77-45a7-87a7-306448c35abc">
<p local-id=3D"49ad90c7-29f8-463d-8955-7e2de826c707">Slight increase in ste=
aric acid for surface modification</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"efe6e21a-4af5-411c-8afc-efec82f494b1">
<p local-id=3D"3c19be25-845b-4e40-b6fe-c44619c2d189">Maintained critical bi=
nder components</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ol>
<h2 local-id=3D"fb0bda57-4128-44d6-a806-d262502335f6" id=3D"JaredHumphreysL=
og-PVP-VASelectionCriteria">PVP-VA Selection Criteria</h2>
