<li local-id=3D"62ca148f-924e-41d0-a5f9-4c607dadaf0d">
<p local-id=3D"7e243fd4-ec17-4f0f-abaf-f7388282df8b">Low molecular weight v=
ariant (K-15 to K-30)</p></li>
