<p local-id=3D"19a34cc9-05d3-4906-bf86-e4e1d597225c">What you're experienci=
ng appears to be a classic case of polymer degradation during slow cooling,=
 potentially through:</p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"d48549c4-52a5-4471-9543-fccf40831bcf">
<li local-id=3D"53550ce4-1d95-4284-b294-6e30b7268a15">
