>
<li local-id=3D"26f85a26-5b10-48fb-add0-f17913ed070d">
<p local-id=3D"4fd8d0fa-80f3-4be7-95c9-014020044593">As the temperature slo=
wly decreases, the polymer network partially "unzips"</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"6ff9ac1a-fbe3-4bfb-847e-d66f624a6179">
<p local-id=3D"895e6bda-4c95-4b65-88ae-7b441667caf7">This is more common wi=
th methacrylate systems (like your PMMA-based binder)</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"e5c21e5a-170f-4309-b46a-c9073d19fad0">
<p local-id=3D"05bb81a0-504a-4e14-aaec-dfcc8aa69719"><strong>Oxygen Inhibit=
