<li local-id=3D"8d16aaa2-3e0d-437f-ad23-274629f38846">
<p local-id=3D"6c70b9f9-2ca3-448f-983b-79ae7085c769">As the oven cools, sma=
ll amounts of oxygen may enter</p></li>
