lasticizers (DBP) can migrate and redistribute</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a85d92f4-872d-4736-ae21-0c05aee8e3c5">
<p local-id=3D"6cbae320-1c0a-42e2-8f1b-75d58856992a">This can create region=
s of weakness in the polymer network</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ol>
