media-id=3D"60a95aea-5fa0-43b1-8f2d-0d8ba9821789" data-media-type=3D"file" =
height=3D"260"></span>
<p local-id=3D"d906234e-5153-4ec8-a4e8-8f67676762ce">2025-06-03</p>
<p local-id=3D"b2a9aeb7-7d5a-4355-9c2d-40e034829e27">New dovetail mount for=
 Payman=E2=80=99s setup is printed, so I just need to install 9X M5 heat-se=
t inserts for it to be ready for use.</p>
<p local-id=3D"42da7ac7-70d1-45dd-a810-107acd23d86e">HOPPER: HOPPER V3.3.7.=
2 body is printed and ready for post-processing and installation of heat-se=
t inserts. This is not the zero-waste HOPPER design, but is the latest spri=
ng steel gated style HOPPER adapted for use in PILOT 2. It has now been ful=
ly assembled and installed in PILOT 2, and is ready for leveling and testin=
g. I am continuing to work on the design of HOPPER V3.4.0, the first zero-w=
aste gated hopper design. My design concept at the moment is to use a horiz=
ontally-moving steel blade at the bottom of the hopper that is moved and gu=
ided by a pair of the Edmunds optics adjustment stages.</p>
<p local-id=3D"bd31eee6-2e98-4dd7-a58e-47e922336404">Laser IP Meeting:</p>
