with the doser-style hopper did not yield good density, it has been essenti=
ally abandoned for now.</p>
<p local-id=3D"59fe907d-fc17-4478-ac37-0f6eadc821fe">Per Payman, goal of la=
ser is to increase cutting speed and enable manufacturing of fine features.=
</p>
