<p local-id=3D"8a52dfa2-7ddc-49c2-b80b-01db0ef4690a">PILOT: Worked on desig=
n of heater for Epson pilots. This version has 12V bulbs instead of the cur=
rent 120 VAC bulbs to ensure that there are no high-voltage wires running i=
nto the machine enclosure, it has a heat shield to protect operators from t=
ouching hot metal, it has two fans for active cooling of the inner reflecto=
r, and a copper heat sink to provide threads for mounting the bulb holders =
and to enable a thermostatic switch to be mounted to detect if the system i=
s overheating and cut power to it if necessary.</p>
