wering on the printer and it seemed OK. The prints on the Bambu X1E last ni=
ght failed because they came unstuck from the print bed, so I am running so=
me smaller prints now after applying Magigoo to the print bed. There is sti=
ll some print warpage going on and the parts are pretty rough so I am consi=
dering switching from PAHT-CF to PETG-CF to get a better surface finish and=
