n one of the Pilots. I have a print running on the FormLabs for all compone=
nts that hold an endstop or an endstop mount and a print running on the X1E=
 for new monitor mounts from PLA-CF that was included with the X1E (I have =
some PAHT-CF and PETG-CF coming from Bambu, but they likely won=E2=80=99t b=
