=E2=80=9CE=E2=80=9D). Began labeling the wires; I am experimenting with sev=
eral approaches, including adhesive letters that wrap around the wire that =
then need to have heat shrink tubing or tape applied around them, or using =
the heat shrink tubing label printer, which seems easier, as long as you ne=
ed to use heat shrink either way. Meeting about documentation. Mostly compl=
