al software testing done today, I updated the schematic to match the wiring=
 in Epson 1. Once Epson 1 is signed off on and locked down, Epson 2 will ne=
ed to be rewired to match the schematic. Marcus sent out an email about res=
ource allocation for the next 2 Pilots:</p>
