<p local-id=3D"c83b2ad2-c9e0-46d5-a2de-6d214a4546f1">The original heater us=
ed a 12VDC bulb as the heat source. In the new design, the same type of bul=
b is used, but the voltage has been changed from 12VDC to 24VDC. The purcha=
se and connection details are shown below.</p></li>
</ol>
