<h3 local-id=3D"e8bfd9c6-459c-4295-9176-a8d0ed1c406a" id=3D"JaredHumphreysL=
og-EquipmentRequired.1">Equipment Required</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"a718e9fc-dc46-4c14-a742-0bb955e4c70c">
<li local-id=3D"9f441399-3d8d-4c96-9b25-3e75dceb194d">
<p local-id=3D"814d4721-047e-490f-a4ba-278434bd0dbb">Heating plate or hot w=
ater bath</p></li>
