<p local-id=3D"bcdb2eb3-5aaf-4f6e-b9e9-de202cc2e655">Magnetic stirrer or me=
chanical mixer</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"9295cd24-1cdd-419c-8f41-3f0d9d1447cf">
<p local-id=3D"dc0872ec-53eb-43b6-b5d1-86dc04c43a57">Thermometer</p></li>
