<p local-id=3D"5751c3bd-1e9c-4667-a40a-e6de62b1414b">Mixing vessel (glass o=
r stainless steel)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"6c63ee87-603e-44ed-a06b-10cd34073235">
<p local-id=3D"d226aa71-a490-4cc3-b2f7-8c36fd4e1841">Drying trays (non-stic=
k or lined)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a7b69dd4-8aa6-45fc-89b7-e3fe4b208acf">
<p local-id=3D"218cb6ec-ebdd-4fa2-a8e6-0386c5d17593">Convection oven or dry=
ing cabinet</p></li>
