<h3 local-id=3D"d0dda1eb-a668-4172-8a70-289aa7cc7fa4" id=3D"JaredHumphreysL=
og-Procedure.10">Procedure</h3>
<h4 local-id=3D"99221748-4575-4840-8f7c-07d74746540a" id=3D"JaredHumphreysL=
og-Step1:BinderSolutionPreparation">Step 1: Binder Solution Preparation</h4=
>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"4e349aa6-0646-42c3-8084-7dd25936094f">
<li local-id=3D"0d5881a1-529a-4ba2-b15c-83886583a788">
<p local-id=3D"5bf43d56-a9d6-408f-8beb-9b058efde6b7">Heat 75-100 mL deioniz=
ed water to 80=C2=B0C in mixing vessel</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"f02c674b-6dad-433a-8178-f7ecfec9be8e">
<p local-id=3D"bc97260b-72a1-41e0-b376-e78a821018df">Add ingredients in the=
 following order with continuous stirring:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"6bd50892-e8c8-4409-a9f2-dc0b9d4bbe53">
<li local-id=3D"3422573e-b9dd-444a-9cbb-40fd4b4772d3">
<p local-id=3D"b8df1458-b648-484f-9f80-2ed6736497ac">PEG 1000 (9.0g) - diss=
olve completely</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"080d253e-d38f-400d-89ed-098b64d10b77">
<p local-id=3D"d9fc074a-9dc5-4ba1-9157-a03e2a813414">Maltodextrin (1.0g) - =
dissolve completely</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"849b280f-104d-405d-84f0-45c6ba74385b">
<p local-id=3D"c6672c15-905b-4498-b55f-2074695607a9">PVP-VA (3.0g) - dissol=
ve completely</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"3a6de958-fbc7-4c0a-947f-aeede26cb801">
<p local-id=3D"9325ff55-431e-416d-978b-48e7d201d30f">PVA (2.0g) - dissolve =
completely (may require 20-30 minutes)</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"cd19f640-6435-472c-bd72-b0650131deed">
<p local-id=3D"d8ae3869-314c-43cf-ab66-f786f74bde98">Maintain temperature a=
t 75-80=C2=B0C during dissolution</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ca14f3bf-7544-4861-9119-6ecaac27642f">
<p local-id=3D"3e4653f6-712f-4d02-ba8d-7c23f9027af5">Continue stirring unti=
l solution is clear and homogeneous</p></li>
</ol>
<h4 local-id=3D"3b91621e-3e30-4b50-912f-6cb237044ced" id=3D"JaredHumphreysL=
og-Step2:PowderCoating">Step 2: Powder Coating</h4>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"ca0c2536-ff44-4d50-9780-5d96763d1a8b">
<li local-id=3D"1555318a-a773-4288-800e-f4e142458a1d">
<p local-id=3D"cf98a428-8051-4cea-9f4e-9f9d1bae185a">Verify binder solution=
 temperature is 70-80=C2=B0C</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"125f2e17-a808-4972-ba3b-36950cbd9632">
<p local-id=3D"0389cc95-0366-496a-89d4-a7239e53df10">Add 970g 17-4 PH metal=
 powder while stirring continuously</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ac3bb1e9-a66b-4f83-848c-cd0c35ba7bb2">
<p local-id=3D"3d9e3e69-8eb9-475b-aee3-79a37b6d5dbb">Mix thoroughly for 5-1=
0 minutes to ensure uniform coating</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"10ac38d4-41ed-4d6e-865a-169b470b0662">
<p local-id=3D"e255f48b-9f61-4a8e-a3be-99f0178313dd">Continue mixing until =
a homogeneous slurry is achieved</p></li>
</ol>
<h4 local-id=3D"dd6c5a94-75a1-45fd-8281-40471a89d6e3" id=3D"JaredHumphreysL=
og-Step3:Drying">Step 3: Drying</h4>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"7ada7b93-9e68-4803-a491-ec03e5f19baa">
<li local-id=3D"0045a86e-ff19-427b-9c08-ff240a8d517f">
<p local-id=3D"f2995ade-04fa-412e-90c2-c1aad94c979e">Spread slurry thinly (=
5-10mm depth) in drying trays</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"c9bb7f80-bc99-4e1a-9c5e-e17d578b46ae">
<p local-id=3D"46e7b5f5-5a3e-4077-894f-9b1d06b3a9f3">Dry at 40-50=C2=B0C wi=
th good airflow</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ab97787d-6888-498a-9400-c5a890d48a02">
<p local-id=3D"cce5f8c2-6f86-490b-9475-380bfac7d36f">Continue drying until =
material forms a friable cake</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"8c718ea9-f4c2-45a9-8704-aa6bfb44438e">
<p local-id=3D"b2e14e8b-6f4a-48d0-ae51-ba0b26c5a26a">Typical drying time: 4=
-8 hours (verify by testing small sample)</p></li>
</ol>
<h4 local-id=3D"bc831217-c0fd-4f63-9bae-e1a4ab88b0dd" id=3D"JaredHumphreysL=
og-Step4:SizeReduction">Step 4: Size Reduction</h4>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"57652649-7f17-4d64-8707-02345bc9f143">
<li local-id=3D"14ad0d81-0acb-4337-befd-81f4466b9e70">
<p local-id=3D"1fb7e7f7-0213-4993-83fd-c0b88bab7869">Break dried cake by ha=
nd or with gentle grinding</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"107be2a0-7624-419d-9620-cb240bb331dd">
<p local-id=3D"a21d0b5b-7abd-47b3-9112-b57d23b42907">Sieve through appropri=
ate mesh sizes to match original PSD</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"3a9f52f3-a686-4ece-8f64-9f9e3fd30266">
<p local-id=3D"047ebc55-4c40-481e-96fe-3458343a5f4b">Collect powder in airt=
ight container</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"bdb8b0de-f04c-420f-bdcb-66789d403bce">
<p local-id=3D"925580f9-0e28-48d9-af59-6b95c8dae6fe">Label with batch numbe=
r and date</p></li>
</ol>
<hr local-id=3D"8b055695-3f28-47fe-8adb-b49010f94820" data-layout=3D"wide" =
data-width=3D"760">
<h3 local-id=3D"7b5c595d-65af-43de-a9d8-18fb2c447bc3" id=3D"JaredHumphreysL=
og-QualityControlChecks.1">Quality Control Checks</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"2e2e629e-55b6-41a6-bf51-00534ea86a95">
<li local-id=3D"c3c1eb17-e0b3-4e52-bde5-d30ad9eab0f3">
<p local-id=3D"02523aab-129e-442a-8433-be0c44630263">[ ] All binder compone=
nts fully dissolved (clear solution)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"5f4e8223-14fc-4244-9c4c-c1620e1eea4d">
<p local-id=3D"6f927a26-4781-4f60-b2de-8ba70347fff2">[ ] Uniform slurry ach=
ieved before drying</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d30c7477-8875-495a-8083-65827ee19ded">
<p local-id=3D"28179c19-a995-47b5-9534-c0a4ec88cb05">[ ] Powder flows freel=
y at room temperature</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"1394bb22-0290-4449-89de-c15bf4559730">
<p local-id=3D"19a034da-a5a1-484f-9685-15feb09bbcf8">[ ] Particle size dist=
ribution matches original powder</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"f9ec9cdc-c0d5-4ef5-866f-edeb07e62759">
<p local-id=3D"ef0cc6af-d82b-41c1-a559-73a44d2f8a4c">[ ] No excessive agglo=
meration or fines generation</p></li>
</ul>
<hr local-id=3D"89933521-d813-434b-9d61-6667cb063372" data-layout=3D"wide" =
data-width=3D"760">
<h3 local-id=3D"5b985f85-1ab8-4a7b-858b-f06cae27f978" id=3D"JaredHumphreysL=
og-ThermalActivationParameters">Thermal Activation Parameters</h3>
<p local-id=3D"1ac6964c-7b4f-4fa0-8590-9f654bce1cf6"><strong>Activation Tem=
perature:</strong> 80-120=C2=B0C<br><strong>Expected Behavior:</strong> Bin=
ders soften and flow to create strong inter-particle bonding</p>
<p local-id=3D"aa65b156-63c2-4a87-a0e3-af78cfd8ffea"><strong>Mechanism:</st=
rong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"9816ddca-7fc0-4e4b-8395-e5092a467cc6">
<li local-id=3D"439adc0c-8583-4a25-9f27-9ae0bebd1546">
<p local-id=3D"575aa3b9-77b7-4540-b9fc-7424e6f41ac0">PEG 1000 melts complet=
ely (Tm ~35=C2=B0C)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"77a19d3d-411c-4f19-a518-0946644c02c4">
<p local-id=3D"b4afbb73-12c4-491c-862c-b455776b82df">PVA passes through gla=
ss transition (Tg ~85=C2=B0C)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"46bd53a5-5985-4f9c-9308-d6c62cb5c1d3">
<p local-id=3D"cc8f1aed-0f80-4857-9a9a-14b88cddb4b1">PVP-VA softens (Tg ~10=
0-110=C2=B0C)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"cf02b10f-6d79-4253-b5c0-14710be1affb">
<p local-id=3D"6cbc3108-5d8e-4659-aefe-ababfd59119a">Maltodextrin transitio=
ns to rubbery state</p></li>
</ul>
<hr local-id=3D"2f100178-679b-479a-9cc4-fc39981698b0" data-layout=3D"wide" =
data-width=3D"760">
<h3 local-id=3D"6cb7db62-f6f6-4472-bf61-2ca03fcfe3e5" id=3D"JaredHumphreysL=
og-StorageRecommendations">Storage Recommendations</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"bc7db0a9-68b0-4e51-a6d8-3af14d71ea88">
<li local-id=3D"fc4e2421-6724-4822-acb3-adac08a36357">
<p local-id=3D"1390163d-a3e4-4bfe-902f-7e9299a31698">Store in airtight cont=
ainer with desiccant</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"0042d823-b1ad-4184-81a7-d455b9fa200d">
<p local-id=3D"eedf70a8-b76c-47d0-b306-8cc2e100af61">Keep at room temperatu=
re (18-25=C2=B0C)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"92e8ae69-fd4c-4b62-a81f-7b535dd87a27">
<p local-id=3D"298fbd24-df4d-40ae-b745-7f66224843b4">Protect from humidity<=
/p></li>
<li local-id=3D"2585163a-cd27-4aaa-806f-d8d70b7aeaf0">
<p local-id=3D"713cc27e-0cd2-465c-9712-31c5d2b1e6dd">Use within 6 months fo=
r best results</p></li>
</ul>
<hr local-id=3D"6dcaf4c0-471c-4194-aea0-4139f37b4f41" data-layout=3D"wide" =
data-width=3D"760">
<h3 local-id=3D"1f1e42bf-3d17-405a-9ac2-01c27e67a833" id=3D"JaredHumphreysL=
og-SafetyNotes">Safety Notes</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"ff99f689-7971-4f45-b2ea-9451c010813a">
<li local-id=3D"804004aa-deea-413f-b956-a1dcd2132d77">
<p local-id=3D"072f96e5-cef0-4a3b-8fe5-d5762ae360b0">Wear appropriate PPE (=
gloves, safety glasses, dust mask)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"be53b17b-21af-4350-9de4-ad02486171f0">
<p local-id=3D"faf253b8-467c-4ee7-90d4-d66bc8bc49b6">Handle metal powder in=
 well-ventilated area</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a308a6da-54d1-4ebb-a98c-a58b4302bf94">
<p local-id=3D"633790b6-28c4-4a96-8d41-f3187f3a7bb1">Avoid inhalation of dr=
ied powder</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"976f97ce-7aa6-4cef-b59e-96f2d9d4230c">
<p local-id=3D"4a070ca5-08cd-4f4f-a722-327984558a67">Follow standard metal =
powder handling procedures</p></li>
</ul>
<hr local-id=3D"67d1b66d-b022-4df8-b0df-3b5afc5bd774" data-layout=3D"wide" =
data-width=3D"760">
<h3 local-id=3D"57ab02e4-6c50-4242-9c82-791e9d664e58" id=3D"JaredHumphreysL=
og-DebindingRecommendations">Debinding Recommendations</h3>
<p local-id=3D"2a597cea-1847-464c-b796-e0ed7a9a4bb2"><strong>Thermal Debind=
ing:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"94f8be85-d8f1-4249-91b1-4475be6a8f5d">
<li local-id=3D"7835be59-ea72-40aa-b907-f7dd44b4f7bd">
<p local-id=3D"4dcb970a-72a0-416b-b095-e4104668ddc8">Ramp slowly from room =
temperature to 450=C2=B0C</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"e32eeb0d-bbb3-4e90-80f2-52892eded1e3">
<p local-id=3D"f81da2d4-8d3a-4d46-94b5-946b2efd57ee">Use 0.5-2=C2=B0C/min h=
eating rate</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"6cd59b27-1b54-4036-ab28-bfd4f33af8d1">
<p local-id=3D"80cc3128-2773-4a80-873f-3bfc2fe91c79">Hold at intermediate t=
emperatures (150=C2=B0C, 250=C2=B0C) to allow complete decomposition</p></l=
i>
<li local-id=3D"0aba9e9f-8e6e-43d7-a491-44253d4327a4">
<p local-id=3D"5de595ec-aab6-4b7c-b205-e453c4996285">Perform in air or cont=
rolled atmosphere</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"3a969c3a-78ed-4e9c-85fc-c13b6e9c8671"><strong>Solvent Debind=
ing (Optional Pre-step):</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"0ddda9ab-dce2-4510-b6d9-2d7f3bc8b1e3">
<li local-id=3D"17038363-5abc-481d-beea-06c9d7481fb7">
<p local-id=3D"b1f944f7-1bab-48f3-af15-5f66b6838dd8">Water-soluble binders =
can be partially removed at 40-60=C2=B0C</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"63464100-9839-4b8d-bc13-54cc67569c7a">
<p local-id=3D"2a1a5316-8d73-4e7b-a3ba-2a82687c5149">Reduces thermal debind=
ing time</p></li>
</ul>
<hr local-id=3D"81c272a7-79e6-4890-a842-a0ce28138270" data-layout=3D"wide" =
data-width=3D"760">
<p local-id=3D"404d8293-14e4-4902-a312-fea97216e90b"><strong>Recipe Version=
:</strong> 1.0<br><strong>Date:</strong> December 2025<br><strong>Notes:</s=
trong> Test batch recommended before full-scale production</p>
<p local-id=3D"937471bc-17e4-4b15-8c2b-80c4d6d87371">I mixed up a batch and=
 it is definitely more friable than previous PVA-based recipes, so I coarse=
ly ground a few chunks in the mortar and pestle and poured it into a cerami=
c crucible to cook to 300F.</p>
<p local-id=3D"42e968d3-0c43-4011-95d2-5e87701ba24a">PILOT: Supporting Cisc=
o and Ning with wiring of PILOT 6. Laser engraved the last switch plaques n=
ecessary and installed them on PILOT 6. Need to order some solid blocks for=
 the Icotek cable glands to block off ports that are not being used, as wel=
l as some o-ring stock to block off holes in cable gland blocks that are no=
t being used.</p>
<p local-id=3D"4c17cdba-682f-479f-97ac-238b7f0ca598">GENERAL R&amp;D: They =
finally revoked my ability to order directly from McMaster; being trusted e=
nough to order from McMaster directly was the last of my job perks. I raise=
d the point with Marcus that that will tend to delay projects by a day or t=
wo, and he said that was an acceptable sacrifice. It=E2=80=99s something I =
was expecting to happen since Lionel=E2=80=99s time; eventually every start=
up transitions from a fast pace where the priority is speed with less regar=
d for small purchases to a slower paced company where the priority is minim=
izing all costs rather than speed. The new google form purchasing system is=
 now mandatory. It has some issues:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"2cf3877b-3333-47f2-8b1a-8510a76db74a">
<li local-id=3D"c001f392-e95a-4ac8-8517-7c5292601d04">
<p local-id=3D"e454caa8-0408-4ff7-8d58-58cec15e8d52">It is not possible to =
enter in order quantities</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"e0d4a925-38aa-43f2-af8e-890640e42dcc">
<p local-id=3D"074fa2b6-fc21-4dea-9b17-223bf01eb292">It is only possible to=
 to order one item at a time</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"1bcce257-7714-4217-8dfd-00b1217e39ab">
<p local-id=3D"086d3e4e-cd34-49b8-8944-3defc295c483">There is no visibility=
 of order statuses</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"baac5b8c-ec0f-4c54-a926-464b9fa81b30">
<p local-id=3D"894d9c4f-88cd-4f83-8f49-cddbf100cc7d">It is not possible to =
assign responsibility of purchases to different people</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"47afcd0a-8815-4e62-ae02-58b0ed0d6016">
<p local-id=3D"487547ad-f17d-4d9f-8c47-80bc86c4c2b1">It is not possible to =
search through past orders</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"497b7aa0-c3f1-4a79-8098-de17276df386">
<p local-id=3D"75f52dd3-65c9-4b90-974f-218e1b062b41">Purchasing information=
 is siloed to a small number of individuals, so it is possible for the comp=
any to lose access to the information</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"7e3304c4-b801-4882-a279-a6da9bde93ce">
<p local-id=3D"13e5be56-483c-49f5-aeb2-7a81009d6aee">The time to enter in i=
nformation is extended by the number of required fields and pages of the go=
ogle form</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"4d48aab2-2e81-4cc6-8140-2f64889e7e03"></p>
<p local-id=3D"23c6afa1-782e-4d5d-bc3f-009c3b3241ac">2025-12-02</p>
<p local-id=3D"db21fa15-a8e1-4442-ac06-9bc89a46714a">GENERAL R&amp;D: IHI v=
s optimal design process for thruster?</p>
<p local-id=3D"a213832c-87cd-4b2a-a0a5-f17238e31eef">Was discussing the ove=
rall process of developing the IHI Aerospace thruster with Devin. The proje=
ct has been going on for about a year now, with the end goal of delivering =
an Inconel 625 hydrazine monopropellant thruster</p>
<p local-id=3D"f62ae0dc-6cbd-401e-9545-422dd3957d3f">Based on IHI Aerospace=
's background and the 3DEO partnership, here's what the development process=
 for a new 5N AM thruster might look like:</p>
<h2 local-id=3D"ee1d5e41-13b1-4aee-96d3-105f6ecb8868" id=3D"JaredHumphreysL=
og-InitialDesignPhase(6-12months)">Initial Design Phase (6-12 months)</h2>
<p local-id=3D"e6fc13a6-1993-424d-b790-8d0157282e00">The team would start w=
ith heritage design data from their existing 5N-class thrusters, then apply=
 Design for Additive Manufacturing (DfAM) principles to reimagine the thrus=
ter. This would involve optimizing for AM's strengths - consolidating parts=
 (potentially combining injector, combustion chamber, and nozzle into fewer=
 pieces), adding internal cooling channels or optimized catalyst bed geomet=
ries that are impossible with traditional manufacturing, and reducing mass =
while maintaining structural integrity.</p>
<h2 local-id=3D"46f25d23-767d-4703-a8bb-96c399438880" id=3D"JaredHumphreysL=
og-MaterialSelectionandTesting(3-6months)">Material Selection and Testing (=
3-6 months)</h2>
<p local-id=3D"9129ccf2-c7f9-4ccd-8945-078103edfe0d">They'd select appropri=
ate metal alloys compatible with 3DEO's Intelligent Layering technology - l=
ikely high-temperature alloys suitable for thruster applications like Incon=
el or specialized stainless steels. Initial material compatibility testing =
with hydrazine or green propellants would be critical, along with thermal a=
nd mechanical property validation.</p>
<h2 local-id=3D"fa6640a5-7349-45af-b60c-a92039a97f15" id=3D"JaredHumphreysL=
og-PrototypeManufacturingandIteration(6-12months)">Prototype Manufacturing =
and Iteration (6-12 months)</h2>
<p local-id=3D"2017ce15-d510-4dfb-8304-578f1398f4e9">Using 3DEO's metal AM =
capabilities, they'd print initial prototypes, conduct non-destructive test=
ing (X-ray, CT scanning) to verify internal geometries and detect any defec=
ts, then perform cold flow testing followed by hot-fire testing. The DfAM a=
pproach allows rapid iteration - if testing reveals issues, they can quickl=
y modify the CAD model and print new versions without tooling changes.</p>
<h2 local-id=3D"46117a28-e2d9-4e27-b793-8209549744d8" id=3D"JaredHumphreysL=
og-QualificationTesting(12-18months)">Qualification Testing (12-18 months)<=
/h2>
<p local-id=3D"a3bcca44-cfeb-4aa5-9f46-8d097968fd49">This is where IHI's 60=
+ years of thruster heritage becomes crucial. They'd conduct comprehensive =
qualification testing including:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"62a9fb28-60ee-4aa6-9e2f-c2993111a3fb">
<li local-id=3D"2ed7caaa-d35e-40e3-91aa-e5347733503b">
<p local-id=3D"c4a39b1d-2847-49b0-bce1-a4813ed28d48">Performance characteri=
zation (thrust, specific impulse, duty cycles)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"f6393ddf-aed1-4624-88d2-691e4627ae76">
<p local-id=3D"cce5c07a-6217-479e-8a61-3a6b25dfa4a6">Life testing (thousand=
s of pulses or continuous burns)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a788277e-7083-47ac-835b-db63062a8551">
<p local-id=3D"b80c74a8-1e26-48c7-806e-1b7150a5e0a8">Environmental testing =
(vibration, thermal cycling, vacuum)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"4afe132a-cabb-4207-b787-02e631fa5dd0">
<p local-id=3D"c1b97d9c-b04a-42c4-a513-94d68769386b">Propellant compatibili=
ty long-term exposure</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ec93a25c-2963-4bd0-bb9d-ebb2ad406580">
<p local-id=3D"795cb6fe-688f-40fc-acd0-583180e6486b">Comparison against her=
itage thruster performance benchmarks</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"81a1b479-a8ad-4c43-babb-6a6fec9d2e5c" id=3D"JaredHumphreysL=
og-SupplyChainandQualitySystemDevelopment(6-12months,overlapping)">Supply C=
hain and Quality System Development (6-12 months, overlapping)</h2>
<p local-id=3D"51ceaf07-d863-4fb6-ab0c-7f1e0b3eccdf">Establishing AM-specif=
ic quality control procedures, developing process controls for 3DEO's manuf=
acturing (powder quality, build parameters, post-processing), and creating =
inspection protocols. They'd also work on scaling - ensuring consistent qua=
lity across multiple builds and establishing procedures for series producti=
on.</p>
<h2 local-id=3D"62e6eefe-1cc3-45fc-bddd-e2caaf019483" id=3D"JaredHumphreysL=
og-CustomerQualificationandCertification(12-24months)">Customer Qualificati=
on and Certification (12-24 months)</h2>
<p local-id=3D"caf03bae-a3ff-4fe9-9610-1d0679cb0b2b">Working with potential=
 customers (satellite manufacturers) and possibly JAXA for flight qualifica=
tion. This involves providing test data, design documentation, and reliabil=
ity assessments. For US customers, there may be export control consideratio=
ns to navigate.</p>
<h2 local-id=3D"585b8816-9e76-430f-8d96-3ee26a39bf9c" id=3D"JaredHumphreysL=
og-FlightHeritageDevelopment(2-5yearspost-launch)">Flight Heritage Developm=
ent (2-5 years post-launch)</h2>
<p local-id=3D"31f3b9a1-21ba-45c1-bb0d-f5b0d632f6de">The first flight units=
 would likely go on more risk-tolerant missions - perhaps small satellites =
or secondary payloads. Success here builds the flight heritage database tha=
t's critical for adoption on higher-value missions.</p>
<h2 local-id=3D"82f65e4c-bebd-41d1-afe9-de4bff9a0a05" id=3D"JaredHumphreysL=
og-OverallTimelineEstimate">Overall Timeline Estimate</h2>
<p local-id=3D"19db2f34-52ba-41c8-b7ef-e6dbafc33f4c"><strong>Optimistic sce=
nario:</strong> 3-4 years from project kickoff to first commercial sales <s=
trong>Realistic scenario:</strong> 4-6 years to achieve meaningful market p=
enetration with flight heritage <strong>Conservative scenario:</strong> 6-8=
 years if significant technical challenges emerge</p>
<h2 local-id=3D"dc6aa81a-4022-48af-bdbf-08e4e9dbfe6b" id=3D"JaredHumphreysL=
og-KeyAdvantagesofthe3DEOCollaboration">Key Advantages of the 3DEO Collabor=
ation</h2>
<p local-id=3D"2eaa9046-f1bf-4683-a7ce-290810eb930c">The partnership likely=
 accelerates this timeline compared to developing AM capabilities in-house.=
 3DEO brings established AM processes and DfAM expertise, while IHI brings =
deep thruster knowledge and an existing customer base. The cost reduction f=
rom AM could make 5N thrusters more accessible for smallsat markets, potent=
ially opening new applications.</p>
<h2 local-id=3D"92a09ede-4158-4b8f-93ea-e18b245c8674" id=3D"JaredHumphreysL=
og-PotentialChallenges">Potential Challenges</h2>
<p local-id=3D"7effb256-0536-4a2d-aee1-b8cebe514411">Convincing conservativ=
e aerospace customers to adopt AM components, establishing equivalent or be=
tter reliability than heritage manufactured thrusters, navigating the inter=
section of US export controls (3DEO is US-based) with Japanese aerospace in=
terests, and managing the tension between cost reduction goals and aerospac=
e qualification requirements.</p>
<p local-id=3D"ef97db8e-dd90-4e63-ad7e-774b3044fe01">Does this align with w=
hat you were thinking, or were you interested in a particular phase of the =
process?</p>
<p local-id=3D"5c0d3414-8488-42f1-b6c6-901e35a939ac">JH</p>
<p local-id=3D"2075b21a-7ad2-49f4-b769-c90ab7a7fb17">Can you break down the=
 initial design phase into more detail?</p>
<p local-id=3D"f59564b2-2ef3-4bbd-84a3-33319f224e5a">I'll break down the In=
itial Design Phase into much more detail:</p>
<h2 local-id=3D"857f3cfe-0c71-4c27-b3fe-5abac85c1eaf" id=3D"JaredHumphreysL=
og-InitialDesignPhase(6-12monthstotal)">Initial Design Phase (6-12 months t=
otal)</h2>
<h3 local-id=3D"a0adda0f-a32c-4648-9c94-3ab9b5c25494" id=3D"JaredHumphreysL=
og-Phase1:RequirementsDefinition&amp;Baseline(4-6weeks)">Phase 1: Requireme=
nts Definition &amp; Baseline (4-6 weeks)</h3>
<p local-id=3D"0007dfaf-8390-404f-9140-d7c4a62facb3"><strong>Performance Re=
quirements:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"d378a0d4-bd53-49b3-a09d-471fc08438d0">
<li local-id=3D"87996684-8fdf-4269-b3db-5eae78fad54f">
<p local-id=3D"e9a09a43-7cf9-45b1-a91c-4504568c260d">Define target thrust (=
5N =C2=B1tolerance)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"b854a574-017b-40c0-b704-4c5227776293">
<p local-id=3D"c286ce6a-f7d4-4382-b40d-2be7d7741835">Specify specific impul=
se targets (likely 220-230s for monopropellant hydrazine)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"21fbbb7c-5e8e-46d2-b001-7dbbffb92b1a">
<p local-id=3D"b3812a0b-bba6-47ad-8bc8-f4ddac66c9f0">Determine minimum impu=
lse bit for precision maneuvering</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"4fe896da-0c70-4b63-b54f-63dacd50fa69">
<p local-id=3D"d94aa4a7-a3e1-46ab-9d49-92a894314f9f">Set duty cycle require=
ments (continuous vs. pulsed operation)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"f6708eb0-fc04-48fb-aad8-04428e9a1f4f">
<p local-id=3D"c277a703-e583-4add-a629-f315496be8f0">Establish lifetime req=
uirements (total impulse, number of pulses, years on-orbit)</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"ba81c315-fe5b-453f-a021-f6651752b323"><strong>Mission Profil=
e Analysis:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"aa9067c9-b3c9-44a8-b6ec-7057413a9e09">
<li local-id=3D"ef95e14e-cf5a-4444-b311-6824fede2d23">
<p local-id=3D"b049c58d-160f-423f-a1d5-32b1ff2baddd">Identify target satell=
ite platforms (smallsat attitude control, constellation station-keeping, et=
c.)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"78ccfd44-e301-4010-bec9-beb99b6fbbce">
<p local-id=3D"aae359be-cf74-4c92-bdbe-8a3db9419a7c">Define operational env=
ironment (thermal, vacuum, radiation)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"7b5811c8-6499-47df-91ba-54f9a3df2143">
<p local-id=3D"7632e0ba-2771-41fb-9511-2b43e5b734db">Establish interface re=
quirements (mounting, propellant feed, electrical)</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"83d73dc0-5621-40ec-adb3-8157a818965c"><strong>Business Case:=
</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"51f62f0c-5f84-4c82-ae69-8d3d58d61445">
<li local-id=3D"373ba90c-4c71-4b86-909c-102490a4df44">
<p local-id=3D"7796045f-8299-46b9-8631-95ea3850e627">Target cost reduction =
vs. traditional manufacturing (AM should enable 30-50% reduction)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"aa20d186-8356-4e7a-9ef5-dc8b09899721">
<p local-id=3D"3fa1ea8a-97a6-4314-856a-5afe54baa645">Production volume proj=
ections</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ef0bf283-9d10-4b7f-8461-4f0a635b43d1">
<p local-id=3D"2e73d992-ea4a-43da-b0f5-71c0ac6f6a83">Time-to-market constra=
ints</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"41ab3185-226a-444a-b421-be612a1c5d12">
<p local-id=3D"92871186-5329-4817-b4b0-08239c2b1085">Competitive positionin=
g against other 5N thrusters</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"97f5013d-f25c-49b1-8182-f5c805494e29" id=3D"JaredHumphreysL=
og-Phase2:HeritageDesignReview(6-8weeks)">Phase 2: Heritage Design Review (=
6-8 weeks)</h3>
<p local-id=3D"7720b7cc-483a-4fb2-94ed-c316b6805162"><strong>Existing Desig=
n Analysis:</strong> IHI would thoroughly review their heritage 5N-class th=
rusters (they have experience from 1N to 50N range):</p>
<ul local-id=3D"760c9ac1-8925-445e-9ca5-f118d2cad0df">
<li local-id=3D"4929d051-7375-48c3-a500-7d8ace660bee">
<p local-id=3D"95cc8f36-97b6-4833-b6ab-8b4140b5abf2">Catalog all components=
: injector assembly, catalyst bed chamber, catalyst retention screens, nozz=
le, valve interface</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"e29cdeae-3489-4723-90af-24bd908bc7d4">
<p local-id=3D"1193a87e-cfd1-46e7-996b-bf6a0b46d6c8">Document known failure=
 modes and design margins</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"3abf2dd4-bd86-4722-bf2f-f38d8e825646">
<p local-id=3D"ddc881b9-4aca-4fba-ae43-5cf1897510a8">Review thermal managem=
ent approaches</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"0fceda37-bc9b-4d5f-8cf8-1f0bcb666513">
<p local-id=3D"86902158-6e7b-4f73-b7bb-ce28878eeec4">Analyze propellant dis=
tribution patterns</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"6dae7b83-d3cb-4e88-8d9b-1ec7046ae583">
<p local-id=3D"8e41c07e-74a3-4475-bacb-5b94c63d06ff">Extract lessons learne=
d from flight anomalies or test failures</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"34e24391-4a9f-4c53-8be4-9e3b226f6cdf"><strong>Performance Ba=
seline:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"c0b124a7-2f80-4d30-883b-b665109d242c">
<li local-id=3D"07d56147-ddc5-4688-9797-13500b2a93af">
<p local-id=3D"14d03c78-1d46-4d46-bcf6-4dda967f1630">Map existing manufactu=
ring constraints that drove design decisions</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"b682b476-4441-442e-a3c2-68b5e35ab592">
<p local-id=3D"67193d25-6c5e-443e-9a22-b2324bc32b7d">Identify over-designed=
 features (extra mass for manufacturing tolerances)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"30f7ceac-1bb1-46fd-a9b4-9cecaec5c2db">
<p local-id=3D"c8f67291-2c5d-42cd-b06c-08f74110b263">Document assembly comp=
lexity (number of parts, welds, brazes)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"01080ef8-d40a-4fbd-af05-7de58616fb17">
<p local-id=3D"85db9bb7-4644-4317-815f-2d4d1da74b1b">Calculate current prod=
uction costs and lead times</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"51f31752-4c06-49cb-8c75-b055575a8b7d" id=3D"JaredHumphreysL=
og-Phase3:AMFeasibilityAssessment(4-6weeks)">Phase 3: AM Feasibility Assess=
ment (4-6 weeks)</h3>
<p local-id=3D"2075285e-c069-4495-b5b8-facaf92cdb6e"><strong>3DEO Technolog=
y Review:</strong> Understanding the specific capabilities and limitations =
of 3DEO's Intelligent Layering technology:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"9546c815-2322-4357-8ed8-8194158be9dc">
<li local-id=3D"38c9b273-5dad-4102-ba54-e4ac2ea793b4">
<p local-id=3D"5afd61aa-2746-4f36-a98c-2a4b19acbfda">Build volume constrain=
ts</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a6961a86-bd06-4789-8224-5aecde4d0f00">
<p local-id=3D"e4927bcf-00cb-402d-a750-67c438aa612e">Minimum feature sizes =
and wall thicknesses</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"3908dee6-d342-4435-8faf-ff52372aea93">
<p local-id=3D"ac510428-949d-48ee-9817-eb1543e7b0e2">Surface finish capabil=
ities (critical for catalyst bed and nozzle throat)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"8d9d9384-eebd-4e75-b0e8-d195df00188a">
<p local-id=3D"808e58f2-03a8-42ff-9a8d-970cd96f822b">Material options and t=
heir thermal/chemical properties</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"21e3402d-e1fa-4af1-ab42-90399f2c2623">
<p local-id=3D"e6b56f6b-fd80-4dae-a5cc-624448a8d93b">Support structure requ=
irements and removal</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a984fd33-e779-4559-873b-72963a3adc92">
<p local-id=3D"4fa12e41-2f68-45e0-96a3-519f134936e6">Orientation effects on=
 part properties</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"1e3871d6-f9b4-4248-b4f2-a245c4e5137f"><strong>Printability A=
nalysis:</strong> For each heritage component:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"9620ba1f-8faf-433b-b356-b52fca207b34">
<li local-id=3D"8a1cddfb-4a13-4ab1-b709-c2f623f9e479">
<p local-id=3D"fd39262f-9e02-454b-83e4-9633e963c543">Can it be printed as-i=
s?</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"109e5cd2-06a4-47ce-bc42-95e13d8dc4b5">
<p local-id=3D"eeda464d-5e43-4ecc-bf92-f9e523bc443a">What modifications are=
 needed for printability?</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"04215742-8d0b-48f1-8223-ca881b6c2fc2">
<p local-id=3D"4dd6d730-cdcf-4d95-8c6f-8d4504f10eae">What tolerances are ac=
hievable?</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"b00558db-28f9-4384-9e4a-d15f68e1ba1c">
<p local-id=3D"e701b376-c810-46d6-8212-c72f204d21f7">Where are critical dim=
ensions that need post-machining?</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"5c04c111-d827-4169-8074-1774d1fa63a9" id=3D"JaredHumphreysL=
og-Phase4:DfAMConceptualDesign(8-12weeks)">Phase 4: DfAM Conceptual Design =
(8-12 weeks)</h3>
<p local-id=3D"4a619e62-9b51-48a0-ac27-b701c76b2c53"><strong>Part Consolida=
tion Strategy:</strong> This is where AM really shines:</p>
<p local-id=3D"65696aa2-a4d0-48cb-b52a-7f0c6989379f"><em>Option 1 - Moderat=
e Consolidation:</em></p>
<ul local-id=3D"997aa26f-79ea-47c7-b360-350c60726189">
<li local-id=3D"3d1089c1-6a1e-449b-89d6-8e275c530856">
<p local-id=3D"ec02b86f-32ec-48bb-b62d-38efdb56d953">Combine injector plate=
 with chamber body (eliminate welded joint)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"10b96289-2f89-4583-b5b7-bc85eebc5123">
<p local-id=3D"983dd355-b37d-4454-9d12-adc0cb4d03aa">Integrate catalyst ret=
ention features directly into chamber walls</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"70c8b42d-cfd9-4964-9723-97c977053b04">
<p local-id=3D"9749e413-c8c0-4fd2-97b3-89fd9fef84a3">Print nozzle with opti=
mized contour and chamber as one piece</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"f68893e4-c720-4960-a073-c209edb38683"><em>Option 2 - Aggress=
ive Consolidation:</em></p>
<ul local-id=3D"62036429-8857-4c39-826f-50702420fa3c">
<li local-id=3D"5ddbc11a-b7a5-4f36-9828-a3e26f78fa22">
<p local-id=3D"dd9eba55-8919-4dba-b0ff-568681898661">Single-piece chamber/n=
ozzle/injector assembly</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"9bb71cec-22fd-4f3d-873d-6eea91c2f3a4">
<p local-id=3D"4ae81a96-9c39-4266-8c43-ad1dbfdc742e">Integrated mounting fe=
atures</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"1360247d-6d11-48fa-b5eb-ec7a86617ef5">
<p local-id=3D"8c4e04f3-6f0d-47a4-b04e-83ab3bba589d">Internal conformal coo=
ling channels (if thermal management is critical)</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"a19439a1-9f59-4f99-84b1-309ad6b68adc"><em>Option 3 - Modular=
 Hybrid:</em></p>
<ul local-id=3D"e89e9241-b245-4839-99f2-8bef76f570c8">
<li local-id=3D"944193e1-582c-4af4-894d-64dabea4e972">
<p local-id=3D"d4149a61-200b-4481-8acc-46b574093d92">AM chamber/nozzle body=
</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"eeee1b45-bac7-4121-b73b-e8c6ce422d25">
<p local-id=3D"a25b4b54-e884-4434-9ffb-e25177438498">Traditional machined i=
njector (if ultra-precise orifices are needed)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"7a85450a-a21c-4ac6-ac65-bba915eb5c13">
<p local-id=3D"8ca94776-d657-4c27-8728-6788d425b788">Separate catalyst bed =
cartridge for easier servicing/testing</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"0795e1e0-c52b-46c6-a8c6-738503cb2ab6"><strong>Topology Optim=
ization:</strong> Using computational tools to optimize material distributi=
on:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"be56baaa-fb43-48df-91c0-913f30c61469">
<li local-id=3D"782fc14c-9bb7-419c-80aa-f50b77f7cec3">
<p local-id=3D"07907778-ad0b-4b2b-a3ef-efc470bbf13a">Minimize mass while ma=
intaining structural integrity under pressure loads</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"99dd5769-25ff-4593-8576-d2b195bbf19b">
<p local-id=3D"9ad2df67-982b-499b-94af-e7cbca508594">Optimize for vibration=
 modes (avoid resonances with launch vehicle)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"f32a62b6-97b4-4785-809e-6a9932bcc0df">
<p local-id=3D"7fb588d9-1d48-49a6-88c7-d64873c1a61d">Thermal stress analysi=
s (startup transients, steady-state gradients)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ef29d8a5-ddeb-4e45-975b-dfe7c5a016eb">
<p local-id=3D"c83fc730-0728-47f2-86e0-4d7e46cbc5ef">Consider anisotropic p=
roperties of AM materials</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"c11786a8-0109-4ac2-85be-6264ba8e966c"><strong>Internal Featu=
re Innovation:</strong> Exploiting AM's ability to create complex internal =
geometries:</p>
<p local-id=3D"fe4d1b2f-0fb3-49b3-84a2-0b1eac02e384"><em>Catalyst Bed Innov=
ations:</em></p>
<ul local-id=3D"3a9b3ac0-ba36-48ad-a7c0-2ada1e0a1c5f">
<li local-id=3D"2ba12ec9-414f-4baf-b423-d8f5de92bee7">
<p local-id=3D"daf4ee77-2bf5-4518-b703-c3fa57e8c558">Lattice structures for=
 catalyst retention (replace screens)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"3a4e56a8-f382-4e14-b861-e145fb7ce4e9">
<p local-id=3D"d54cc272-09ea-402c-9169-eb1b3e36bbc6">Optimized flow distrib=
ution geometries</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"473ec5af-11f7-46e2-8d5a-3792efa6b62a">
<p local-id=3D"6cc3fdff-2fb6-437d-b966-89e992a7cb5e">Variable porosity regi=
ons for better propellant distribution</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"0e65bd61-41d9-4236-8571-52e58f7f7b25">
<p local-id=3D"9a0b88a9-38fc-466c-9674-9c50f55b84dc">Integrated pre-heating=
 zones</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"d61644c0-2648-4d2a-a0fc-6a22737898d5"><em>Thermal Management=
:</em></p>
<ul local-id=3D"c291cdb6-02e6-479f-833a-84da7d8fe1be">
<li local-id=3D"0eb2e9ac-efce-421f-9bbb-ffa4807a362c">
<p local-id=3D"2ef8ced9-682f-470f-9abd-a33a6c0d0959">Conformal cooling chan=
nels near nozzle throat</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"af1c295b-a5d6-4880-a957-05e2e3224376">
<p local-id=3D"55a1419a-9d99-45fe-9f52-0f5d3864afc5">Optimized wall thickne=
ss variations (thicker where needed, thinner elsewhere)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"846a5c09-0d63-4681-845d-c55123c28584">
<p local-id=3D"956f19c4-4c60-40aa-b40a-a40f8fb765a0">Integrated heat sinks =
or radiative surfaces</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"b88ba6b7-5cd5-4fe8-a266-0a62c2ed4bdc">
<p local-id=3D"28a8e904-52be-4212-9b55-e9722ea2ccf6">Thermal break features=
 between hot and cold zones</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"bcbf4906-b35c-45fe-942d-42093b155dfa"><em>Injector Optimizat=
ion:</em></p>
<ul local-id=3D"bbc7dd91-1852-44f8-ab28-e34b40de8d7d">
<li local-id=3D"6acead6d-ab8a-402d-bba1-ec7cd70f5eda">
<p local-id=3D"126fb17c-75c9-493f-a755-93d5d7109e68">Multiple injection ang=
les optimized for catalyst bed uniformity</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"bf16a95b-9ae3-44a9-9c06-5ee2a191eab1">
<p local-id=3D"7bacacd5-8560-4c46-849e-4732748b3532">Integrated swirl or im=
pingement features</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"55a7d48e-c394-4383-a3d9-80624f77079c">
<p local-id=3D"74b364f3-c573-46f5-a8f9-e16e7faba2db">Smooth flow transition=
s to reduce pressure losses</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"e5f96dc0-a9a7-4f42-bd20-a0d6c5364a16" id=3D"JaredHumphreysL=
og-Phase5:TradeStudies&amp;DesignSelection(6-8weeks)">Phase 5: Trade Studie=
s &amp; Design Selection (6-8 weeks)</h3>
<p local-id=3D"272ecf85-a0de-4505-ab03-6c9547a51e79"><strong>Multi-Criteria=
 Analysis:</strong> For each design concept, evaluate:</p>
<p local-id=3D"02389f4c-5f32-411d-be21-3663c1cb6238"><em>Performance Metric=
s:</em></p>
<ul local-id=3D"cdbef4e9-f1e6-47ea-a2ca-0a130a7f49be">
<li local-id=3D"2617d35b-9a68-4676-ba9e-b4088638c570">
<p local-id=3D"b81fb62c-5120-4baf-8925-3fce80e12a22">Predicted specific imp=
ulse (CFD modeling)</p></li>
