ion isolators from 31A clear silicone that was left around from a few years=
 back. It was extremely thick from age so I had to pack it into the molds w=
ith a popsicle stick then squish the top of the mold on. The part came out =
with some bubbles, but it actually seems functional enough. I am printing s=
ome more PLA-CF molds in case I need them.</p>
