<p local-id=3D"40bb889a6852">Mohsen Baser Layer Meeting:</p>
<p local-id=3D"013c99375aba">Previous base layer macro took ~50 minutes wit=
h 5 layers requiring a heat pass and layer cooling, but had a very low fail=
ure rate.</p>
<p local-id=3D"8e29b2915551">An optimized version of this takes 15 minutes =
and only has 1 heat pass, with a slightly higher failure rate.</p>
<p local-id=3D"934f86a4889e">Mohsen is running into issues with the corners=
 of the base plate detaching from the build plate and lifting up when a pri=
nt is run with air drying instead of heat pass. The dry air only base layer=
 takes 18 minutes with a high failure rate. As the print is running, the ba=
se layer pulls off of the build plate towards the corners as the humidity i=
n the print chamber decreases. Theory is that the humidity tends to drop ov=
er time because of the dry air being injected to dry each layer.</p>
<p local-id=3D"d69e0d39be32">Options:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"1bcefeb21a78">
<li local-id=3D"dca4b7a37433">
<p local-id=3D"846de7552e42">Continue tests to determine root cause</p></li=
>
<li local-id=3D"090c0c86ee2e">
<p local-id=3D"5e91f674f274">Test making a layer outside of the machine</p>=
</li>
<li local-id=3D"50709ebaa270">
<p local-id=3D"0b3bb26ecd7c">Test using a base layer macro that uses heat p=
asses</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"1f5aae4796cf">
<p local-id=3D"5194c278855c">Test different substrates and coatings for the=
 aluminum (glue stick, PEI, etc.)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"db43bf5eaa28">
<p local-id=3D"58f09266c46b">Test different aluminum coatings/surface treat=
ments</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"21aa92703690">
<p local-id=3D"54721557f9f2">Add humidifier to compensate for the dry air a=
dded</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"e6b67f8ce5c7">An issue was noted that the fan on Pilot 1 ten=
ds to blow air in an annulus without air flow in the center of the flow ann=
ulus, which may lead to poorer layer drying in the center of the build.</p>
<p local-id=3D"c84571415fd0">Payman is particularly concerned with the inte=
rnal stresses that will develop in the cake even if there is good base laye=
r adhesion, so he is more interested in adding humidity to try to resolve t=
he root cause of cake distortion (best guess so far is that it is the dropp=
ing humidity; Mohsen has seen it as low as 20-25%, while the nominal spec i=
s 40%).</p>
<p local-id=3D"e7ecd7f563a2">Pilot 7 is encountering an issue after being m=
oved to the pod: it seems that the layer cooling time always times out inst=
ead of hitting the target temperature. The heat pass macro is also differen=
t from Pilot 6 (ZZ may have changed it because of an issue with the heater =
not turning off when a printer ends).</p>
<p local-id=3D"89a2e00575b8">Mohsen noted that he increased the target temp=
erature to 30C to decrease layer time for the Epson printers, which seemed =
not to have a negative impact on part density.</p>
