<p local-id=3D"6800ffcc104c">HOPPER/FLIP:</p>
<p local-id=3D"379c82b5d986">Fully assembled the mold for casting the silic=
one mold for casting the doser ball and did a pour of Shore 30A silicone. T=
he amount I mixed up was only enough to cover the doser ball by ~2mm, but h=
opefully that should be enough. I mixed up as little silicone as possible t=
o make sure I was not wasting any of it. I had to hammer the doser ball ont=
o the splined shaft because it was so tight; this won=E2=80=99t be an issue=
 with the cast doser ball because the splined shaft itself will be used as =
