 against the 3D printed parts and increase friction so it is easier to clam=
p the duct hose to the 3D printed parts. I am now in the process of figurin=
g out hose routing to connect the hopper to the powder cartridge dock. As e=
xpected, it seems to be a quite tricky problem; I am concerned that the hos=
e will be at a very shallow angle which will make it difficult for the powd=
er to flow into the hopper.</p>
