<p local-id=3D"1c7e31980f20">I pointed out that it is possible that copper =
may require a different laser or this process will not work with any laser =
technology with copper, and Marcus acknowledged that that is a risk. Marcus=
 stated that the process will still be commercially viable even if it canno=
t work on copper.</p>
<p local-id=3D"93f3a50c50d2">Marcus is open to using different lasers for d=
ifferent materials.</p>
<p local-id=3D"8561b897fa82">It is also noted that 17-4PH and 316L powder h=
ave similar absorptivity with 1064nm light, but pure copper has very low ab=
