<p local-id=3D"bfbaa01b04e1">Marcus asked about theories of the fundamental=
 mechanism of cut depth variation with the hatch, and Mason suggested it ma=
y be due to heat transfer causing drying of the other regions before hatchi=
ng during the hatch operation.</p>
<p local-id=3D"511e9c8a6208">Mason and Midhun also raised the idea of testi=
ng the effect of layer curing before the laser cutting operation.</p>
<p local-id=3D"741968426edd">Marcus complimented Midhun and Mason=E2=80=99s=
