<p local-id=3D"dcc89f42ee26">I started a print of a pair of parts (they are=
 needed in an original orientation and a mirrored orientation so I imported=
 the original part, cloned it, and mirrored the clone within the Bambu slic=
er.</p>
<p local-id=3D"9ece9acfa8e4">Let=E2=80=99s think of some possible approache=
s for 3DEO as a company moving forward:</p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"7f996a6c-51c2-4df5-92fa-6b727fbc1c9c">
<li local-id=3D"b8857c37-0134-46c4-aa46-8da933468239">
<p local-id=3D"6c7da1f36120">Operating as a service provider (engineering s=
upport, part/assembly manufacturing, QC)</p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"2c816d72-a6c2-4c7d-a7c6-0b8986447e27">
<li local-id=3D"fbc20ad3-ee99-4ce3-b3f7-eb4c56727c3c">
<p local-id=3D"04c71d7d1940">Buy exemplars of all commonly available 3D pri=
nting and machining technology</p></li>
