and machines, and select the appropriate one for each contract</p></li>
</ol></li>
<li local-id=3D"df77bb18-1274-41f4-8354-a33b7983b879">
<p local-id=3D"c7d60a8aaa8e">Operating as a service provider exclusively us=
ing proprietary printing technology operating with the manufacturing capabi=
lities as before, with new materials added</p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"b2bfa3ee-bf20-4100-aebf-e7f1137b167a">
