ilable and demands for machines.</p>
<p local-id=3D"d3df71c6309e">Mohsen is running experiments on Pilot 7 and h=
as been running into issues with logging data from BME sensors; they are al=
l reading values of 0 for humidity and temperature in the machine.</p>
