 it would be less likely to fall out if the glue joint fails.</p>
<p local-id=3D"3c4d3a0f2c02">I put in an order request for a piece of 1/8=
=E2=80=9D X 1=E2=80=9D 4140 ground steel stock and a 12=E2=80=9D long piece=
