<p local-id=3D"80617f71c35d">The response curve after adding a TMD is inter=
esting; you get a double spike around the target frequency. Those spikes ar=
e still both lower than the original undamped magnitude, but the behavior c=
ould be relevant if the damping needs to be maximized.</p>
