he new spreader bar design, although now that I think about it is still pro=
ne to angling if it is not pressed against the bottom surface when tighteni=
ng the screws. Mohsen also noticed some powder leakage between the side pan=
els and the front and back panels. I suspect this is due to the flexibility=
