<p local-id=3D"7a23a874e281">Making a wafer testing machine with a vacuum c=
huck to hold down the wafer and heat and cool it and a probe card that come=
s down from above. The vacuum chuck has integrated heating and multi-point =
temperature measuring probe. A force of 520 kgf per 25X25mm area is applied=
 to the wafer. 150 W/cm^2. 0.003 micron flatness.</p>
