<li local-id=3D"e432f676453f">
<p local-id=3D"f6257ad2ea2c"><strong>Research recirculating vacuums for Pil=
ot 8</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"b0c874b592d8">
<li local-id=3D"d2982411ec46">
<p local-id=3D"aacc7db61a92">For integrating something into a printer, I=E2=
=80=99m thinking something along these lines:</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"4e859a35a547">
<p local-id=3D"8dc277308f52"><a href=3D"https://www.becker-international.co=
m/sg/en/987/variair-sv-300-1-gas-tight.htm" local-id=3D"698d1c2ea167" data-=
card-appearance=3D"inline" class=3D"external-link" rel=3D"nofollow">https:/=
/www.becker-international.com/sg/en/987/variair-sv-300-1-gas-tight.htm</a><=
/p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ba1fec28b266">
<p local-id=3D"77c81fe9e86b">A sealed air blower combined with a cylone sep=
arator and a series of filters</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"38bc4b0dbd83">
<p local-id=3D"e990590195ee"><strong>Design hopper for copper</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"9926f7c871dd">
<li local-id=3D"56f3ce25017f">
