<p local-id=3D"15f5c780fcea">PILOT:</p>
<p local-id=3D"68ab37b61e0f">Need to print an SVP on the FormLabs for Pilot=
 7. Also need to print the contact point mount for triggering the endstop f=
or the Mest unit Z stage.</p>
<p local-id=3D"d108a6591fff">Started 2 SVPs printing on the FormLabs, altho=
ugh Ben found an SVP that Pourya had been using that can be installed on Pi=
lot 7 immediately. I believe it=E2=80=99s one he rejected because the heigh=
t of the bottom surface of the SVP did not work for his application. It has=
 definitely been used before (there is some powder caked on the inside of t=
he SVP inlet plenum chamber).</p>
<p local-id=3D"8c3ccb1c8c28">I printed a contact point mount for triggering=
 the endstop for the Mest unit Z stage on Pilot 7, but it did not come out =
as well as I=E2=80=99d like, so I am reprinting it in a different orientati=
on.</p>
