<p local-id=3D"64e4d3d9939a">I asked Marcus at the morning standup how the =
talk with him, Alex, and Ken yesterday went, and he said it went fine. Appa=
rently it was not about the theoretical new company, it was just that Ken w=
anted to hear about the current status of projects at 3DEO. Ken was also he=
re most/all of the day yesterday, but seemed to stay in the white room and,=
 as far as I am aware, did not speak with anyone other than Marcus and Alex=
. This morning, Marcus said that the board is currently paying the salary o=
f all 3DEO employees, so they are incentivized to get this new company star=
ted so that it will be paying us instead (or just lay all of us off). There=
 is still no word on whether this new company will even come to exist or no=
