<p local-id=3D"d786bb715236">2026-06-02</p>
<p local-id=3D"bc2dc1f85afd">GENERAL:</p>
<p local-id=3D"aac896613f83">Talked with Senai about the plans for 3D print=
ed parts for the Beta printers, as well as the high level approach and goal=
s for modifying them. It sounds like he plans to reuse as much of the Pilot=
 hardware designs as possible (even down to using the same spreader bar and=
 mist box). I asked if the intent was to use these for production, and he s=
aid that production is not even on our radar yet, the goal is only to provi=
de more printers to Midhun et al, in particular for printing stainless stee=
l powder. This obviously doesn=E2=80=99t make any sense, so I asked Senai h=
ow he felt about all that, and he said something along the lines of he has =
a concrete goal that he is happy to work towards. I said that that=E2=80=99=
s a healthy attitude, or at least a positive attitude, and he said I should=
 try it some time.</p>
<p local-id=3D"102159bbc9e0">This is actually quite an interesting philosop=
hical conundrum. I am also extremely familiar with working towards a goal y=
ou don=E2=80=99t believe in (I always believe everything is going to fail, =
so I am constantly thinking of alternatives and contingencies), but I am al=
so always thinking about what the right thing to do would be, if it were po=
ssible.</p>
<p local-id=3D"9669e91c9aa3">Since I always have these three things in mind=
 (what are we going to do, what might we do within foreseeable limits, and =
what should we do if we had the resources to work towards our end goals opt=
imally) anytime I=E2=80=99m talking with people here, regardless of what I =
actually plan to do in the immediate future, I have a tendency to annoy peo=
ple because some of what I am talking about is not directly relevant to the=
 tasks that we are going to complete in the next few days. Senai in particu=
lar does not seem to appreciate me talking about such high-level goals and =
approaches, so I am going to modify my approach to talking with him. I am g=
oing to avoid talking about:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"243f03873216">
<li local-id=3D"f53520fbcba9">
<p local-id=3D"863e02887edb">High-level company approaches</p></li>
