<p local-id=3D"c7a24320bb3f">&lt;NOTE: they are using the term pyrolysis fo=
r decomposition of PEG, although pyrolysis exclusively refers to decomposit=
ion in the absence of oxygen. Since they are doing decomposition in air it =
is technically not pyrolysis.&gt;</p>
<p local-id=3D"50c28e4adbf7">Where PEG collects during decomposition, there=
