<p local-id=3D"8d2fbfe3970d">Created CAD models of the reference cold plate=
 and the chassis resistor. Also added the fittings to the CAD (there is a b=
rass compression fitting that converts the 3/8=E2=80=9D OD copper tubing to=
 3/8 FNPT threads, and a 3/8=E2=80=9D universal thread to 1/2=E2=80=9D OD P=
TC connector interfaces with that. This will allow the 1/2=E2=80=9D OD poly=
urethane tubing to interface with the copper tubing used in the cold plate.=
