<li local-id=3D"428a6cd07e08">
<p local-id=3D"febea7799ea2">Implement AI assistance for writing LabView co=
de</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"5a1712d4a0b3">
<p local-id=3D"ca1aec782015">Loop in Alex for adding data recording functio=
nality to my current LabView code</p></li>
</ul>
