e50" data-media-type=3D"file" height=3D"291"></span>
<p local-id=3D"bdcbfa697fab">I sent the findings out to Sean and Midhun on =
Slack.</p>
<p local-id=3D"77a19ddf0ccb">Worked on machining the copper heat flux measu=
rement block. I have been having difficulty dialing in the parameters for m=
achining the deep holes, which is not surprising considering that it is a d=
eep hole to be made in copper (which turns out to be one of the major diffi=
culties; copper is so soft that any large chips being pulled up have a tend=
ency to chew up the walls of the holes).</p>
<p local-id=3D"4d9ea9841609"></p>
<p local-id=3D"a1bf243415e9">2026-09-17</p>
<p local-id=3D"b231b34add9e">R&amp;D Hardware Meeting:</p>
<p local-id=3D"9ead5e66f972">Graph published pressure drop of reference HX =
vs measured</p>
<p local-id=3D"b69fcc00f1cf">Mohsen discussed Mest unit variability.</p>
<p local-id=3D"245baf073561">I raised the idea of exploring different fille=
r materials and dispensing systems. Midhun said that it is an option yadda =
yadda.</p>
<p local-id=3D"a5ffb27b1036">I=E2=80=99m going to explore some different di=
spensing technologies (binder jet heads) and materials.</p>
<p local-id=3D"cfc78027609b">Alex is working a plan to lease a temporary bu=
ilding (~6 months) that is not sufficient for our long-term needs but would=
 let us do some work in between leaving our current building and finding ou=
r final building.</p>
<p local-id=3D"054083043e73">Senai discussed updates for the Beta retrofit.=
</p>
<p local-id=3D"e17b57702f69">Talked about environmental control systems. Si=
nce many of the buildings that are being considered do not have AC systems =
installed, Alex is considering having environmental control for each machin=
e instead of controlling the environment in the building.</p>
<p local-id=3D"b78af4d8235b">Discussed hopper nonsense and its readiness fo=
r production use. I pointed out that there are better ways to reduce powder=
 wastage (especially powder recycling, which would reduce powder wastage), =
but Midhun pushed back on it because a recycling/reconditioning line would =
have to do what a reconditioning line does</p>
<p local-id=3D"ce0c5a9117e2"></p>
